-- src:1129 | cơi nới, lắp thêm gây ra.
@ref O-Car rules, BS07 (src:1121-1129)
GIVEN i IS A `A damaged item`
      p IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`BS07 — covers the added item` i `on` p MEANS
        `12 — the supplementary clause` `BS07 modified, extended or added equipment` `extends the cover on` p
    AND i's `approved by the registry and within the inspection's validity`
    AND NOT i's `the loss was caused by the added equipment or the modification`
